---
// Interactive blog article: concept page for the Groundtruth FRM-01.
// Deliberately standalone (no SiteLayout/Tailwind) to keep the piece's
// own art direction; fonts are self-hosted like the rest of the site.
import "@fontsource-variable/archivo";
import "@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/400.css";
import "@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/500.css";
import "@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/600.css";
import { getImage } from "astro:assets";
import heroSrc from "../../assets/images/blog/groundtruth.jpg";

const title = "Groundtruth Modular Channel — Max Hodges";
const description =
  "Concept page for the Groundtruth FRM-01: the Overstayer Modular Channel modeled from 23,040 measured states of the hardware, judged by null tests instead of adjectives.";
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site);
const ogImage = new URL(
  (await getImage({ src: heroSrc, width: 1200, format: "jpeg" })).src,
  Astro.site,
).href;
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Max Hodges" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content={ogImage} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <style is:global>
      /* Layout: full-bleed dark telemetry bands, 1100px measure, mono eyebrows, amber signal accent */
      :root{
        --bg:#0b0d0c;
        --panel:#111513;
        --line:#242b27;
        --fg:#e9ece7;
        --muted:#8d978f;
        --accent:#41e86e;
        --accent-dim:#1f7a3c;
        --good:#9fc47a;
        --display:'Archivo Variable',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
        --mono:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;
        color-scheme:dark;
      }
      *{box-sizing:border-box}
      html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
      body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:var(--display);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}
      img{max-width:100%}
      .inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));padding-right:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px))}
      section{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
      h1,h2,h3{text-wrap:balance;margin:0}
      p{margin:0}
      a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
      a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
      a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}

      .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
      .sechead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:40px;flex-wrap:wrap}
      .sechead .eyebrow{color:var(--muted)}
      .lede{color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch}

      /* site nav (blog breadcrumb) */
      .sitenav{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.03em;padding-block:14px}
      .sitenav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
      .sitenav a:hover{color:var(--fg)}
      .sitenav span{color:var(--line);padding:0 6px}

      /* header */
      header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
      header .inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-block:18px;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
      .wordmark{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg)}
      .wordmark b{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
      nav.product{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
      nav.product a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
      nav.product a:hover{color:var(--fg);text-decoration:none}

      /* hero: full-bleed stage, angled unit render, title laid over it */
      .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
      .stage{position:absolute;inset:0;perspective:1600px}
      .stage::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:
        radial-gradient(1000px 520px at 50% 38%, rgba(65,232,110,.13), transparent 65%),
        radial-gradient(1600px 900px at 50% 115%, rgba(0,0,0,.65), transparent 70%)}
      .unit{position:absolute;left:50%;top:42%;width:min(1560px,170vw);transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotateX(26deg) rotateZ(-8deg);filter:drop-shadow(0 60px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.8))}
      .unit svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
      .hero .inner{position:relative;min-height:min(94vh,980px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;text-align:center;padding-block:96px}
      .hero h1{font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(46px,9vw,112px);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-shadow:0 4px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.95),0 1px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.8)}
      .hero h1 .thin{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
      .hero .sub{font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:var(--muted);max-width:54ch;text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.95)}
      .hero .sub strong{color:var(--fg);font-weight:500}
      .ctarow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:10px}
      .cta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--accent);color:#06140a;border:0;padding:17px 36px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease,transform .15s ease}
      .cta:hover{background:#67f08b;transform:translateY(-1px)}
      .ctanote{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}

      /* stat band under hero */
      .statrow{display:flex;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-block:0}
      .statband .inner{padding-block:0}
      .statband .statrow{border-left:0;border-right:0;border-block:0}
      .stat{flex:1 1 160px;min-width:0;padding:18px 22px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
      .stat:last-child{border-right:0}
      .stat .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,28px);font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
      .stat .l{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}

      /* generic section padding */
      .pad{padding-block:72px}

      /* two-col prose */
      .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px}
      .cols>*{min-width:0}
      @media(max-width:760px){.cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
      .prose p+p{margin-top:1em}
      .prose .muted, .muted{color:var(--muted)}

      /* chain diagram */
      .chain{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:44px}
      .node{flex:1 1 150px;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);padding:16px 14px}
      .node .t{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
      .node .d{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45}
      .node.hot{border-color:var(--accent-dim)}
      .node.hot .t{color:var(--accent)}
      .arrow{align-self:center;color:var(--accent-dim);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;flex:0 0 auto}
      @media(max-width:760px){.chain{flex-direction:column}.arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);align-self:flex-start;margin-left:18px}}

      /* figure panels */
      .figure{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);padding:22px}
      .figure figcaption{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}
      figure{margin:0}
      svg{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto}
      svg text{font-family:var(--mono)}
      .unitfig{margin-top:44px;background:radial-gradient(900px 300px at 50% 0%, #151a17, var(--panel) 75%)}

      /* FRM comparison */
      .frm-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:44px}
      @media(max-width:760px){.frm-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

      /* rig spec list */
      .speclist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:44px}
      .spec{background:var(--panel);padding:20px}
      .spec .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
      .spec .v{font-size:15px;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5}

      /* accuracy meter */
      .meter{margin-top:44px}
      .meter .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,220px) 1fr minmax(64px,auto);gap:14px;align-items:center;padding-block:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
      .meter .row:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
      .meter .name{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;min-width:0}
      .bar{height:10px;background:var(--line);position:relative;min-width:0}
      .bar i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:var(--accent-dim)}
      .bar i.deep{background:var(--accent)}
      .meter .val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:right;color:var(--fg)}
      .footnote{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px;max-width:70ch}

      /* presets */
      .banks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:44px}
      .bank{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);padding:22px}
      .bank h3{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px}
      .bank ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
      .bank li{font-size:14px;padding-block:7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
      .bank li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
      .bank li .hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--mono);text-align:right}

      /* spec table */
      table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:44px;font-size:15px}
      th,td{text-align:left;padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
      th{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}
      .tablewrap{overflow-x:auto}

      /* waitlist band */
      .waitlist{background:radial-gradient(1100px 420px at 50% 120%, rgba(65,232,110,.1), transparent 70%)}
      .waitlist .inner{padding-block:96px;display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:22px;text-align:center}
      .waitlist h2{font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,68px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em}
      .waitlist .lede{text-align:center}

      /* footer */
      footer .inner{padding-block:56px}
      footer .legal{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:80ch}
      footer .legal p+p{margin-top:.8em}
      .foot-mark{font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:22px}
      .foot-mark b{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference){
        .hero h1{animation:rise .5s ease-out both}
        @keyframes rise{from{opacity:.001;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
      }
      @media(max-width:760px){
        .unit{width:230vw;top:40%}
        .hero .inner{min-height:88vh}
      }
    </style>

    <!-- Shared faceplate render: defined once, instanced in the hero and in Fig. 0 -->
    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="panelG" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#23282c"/><stop offset=".35" stop-color="#15191c"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0c0f11"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id="sheenG" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity=".07"/><stop offset=".25" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <radialGradient id="knobG" cx=".35" cy=".3" r=".85">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#4a5156"/><stop offset=".6" stop-color="#26292d"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#121416"/>
        </radialGradient>
        <radialGradient id="capG" cx=".35" cy=".3" r=".9">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#363c41"/><stop offset=".7" stop-color="#1a1d20"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#111315"/>
        </radialGradient>
        <radialGradient id="ledG" cx=".5" cy=".5" r=".5">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#a8ffc4"/><stop offset=".4" stop-color="#41e86e"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#41e86e" stop-opacity="0"/>
        </radialGradient>
        <linearGradient id="vuG" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#0e2416"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#081408"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <clipPath id="vuClip"><rect x="1038" y="45" width="209" height="90" rx="4"/></clipPath>

        <g id="knb">
          <circle r="36" fill="#08090a" opacity=".8"/>
          <circle r="33" fill="url(#knobG)" stroke="#060708" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <circle r="33" fill="none" stroke="#0b0d0e" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="1.8 3.4"/>
          <circle r="21" fill="url(#capG)" stroke="#0b0d0e"/>
          <line x1="0" y1="-30" x2="0" y2="-13" stroke="#41e86e" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </g>
        <path id="tks" d="M -31.1 31.1 A 44 44 0 1 1 31.1 31.1" fill="none" stroke="#3a4146" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="2 23.1"/>
        <g id="scrw">
          <circle r="8" fill="url(#knobG)" stroke="#050607" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="-4.5" y1="0" x2="4.5" y2="0" stroke="#0a0b0c" stroke-width="2.2"/>
        </g>
        <g id="tgl">
          <rect x="-8" y="-21" width="16" height="42" rx="8" fill="#0a0c0d" stroke="#272d31"/>
          <circle cy="-9" r="6.5" fill="url(#capG)" stroke="#060708"/>
        </g>

        <symbol id="fp" viewBox="0 0 1320 240">
          <!-- rack ears -->
          <rect x="2" y="4" width="36" height="232" rx="4" fill="#0e1113" stroke="#1d2225"/>
          <rect x="1282" y="4" width="36" height="232" rx="4" fill="#0e1113" stroke="#1d2225"/>
          <rect x="12" y="30" width="16" height="36" rx="8" fill="#060708"/>
          <rect x="12" y="174" width="16" height="36" rx="8" fill="#060708"/>
          <rect x="1292" y="30" width="16" height="36" rx="8" fill="#060708"/>
          <rect x="1292" y="174" width="16" height="36" rx="8" fill="#060708"/>
          <!-- panel -->
          <rect x="38" y="8" width="1244" height="224" rx="5" fill="url(#panelG)" stroke="#272d31"/>
          <rect x="38" y="8" width="1244" height="224" rx="5" fill="url(#sheenG)"/>
          <use href="#scrw" transform="translate(64 30) rotate(20)"/>
          <use href="#scrw" transform="translate(1256 30) rotate(-35)"/>
          <use href="#scrw" transform="translate(64 210) rotate(70)"/>
          <use href="#scrw" transform="translate(1256 210) rotate(-10)"/>
          <!-- branding -->
          <text x="96" y="76" font-size="21" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="5" fill="#e9ece7">GROUND<tspan fill="#41e86e">TRUTH</tspan></text>
          <text x="96" y="101" font-size="11.5" letter-spacing="2" fill="#8d978f">FRM-01 · SAT. CHANNEL</text>
          <line x1="96" y1="120" x2="250" y2="120" stroke="#272d31"/>
          <circle cx="104" cy="150" r="11" fill="url(#ledG)"/>
          <circle cx="104" cy="150" r="3.5" fill="#c9ffd9"/>
          <text x="92" y="182" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2" fill="#8d978f">SIG</text>
          <use href="#tgl" transform="translate(172 150)"/>
          <text x="158" y="182" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2" fill="#8d978f">HPF</text>
          <use href="#tgl" transform="translate(228 150) rotate(180)"/>
          <text x="214" y="182" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2" fill="#8d978f">PAD</text>
          <!-- knobs -->
          <g transform="translate(330 118)"><use href="#tks"/><use href="#knb" transform="rotate(-50)"/></g>
          <text x="330" y="182" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#8d978f" text-anchor="middle">INPUT</text>
          <g transform="translate(455 118)"><use href="#tks"/><use href="#knb" transform="rotate(65)"/></g>
          <text x="455" y="182" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#8d978f" text-anchor="middle">DRIVE</text>
          <g transform="translate(580 118)"><use href="#tks"/><use href="#knb" transform="rotate(15)"/></g>
          <text x="580" y="182" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#8d978f" text-anchor="middle">COLOR</text>
          <g transform="translate(705 118)"><use href="#tks"/><use href="#knb" transform="rotate(-105)"/></g>
          <text x="705" y="182" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#8d978f" text-anchor="middle">DENSITY</text>
          <g transform="translate(830 118)"><use href="#tks"/><use href="#knb" transform="rotate(40)"/></g>
          <text x="830" y="182" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#8d978f" text-anchor="middle">XFORMER</text>
          <g transform="translate(955 118)"><use href="#tks"/><use href="#knb" transform="rotate(-15)"/></g>
          <text x="955" y="182" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#8d978f" text-anchor="middle">OUTPUT</text>
          <!-- VU meter -->
          <rect x="1038" y="45" width="209" height="90" rx="4" fill="url(#vuG)" stroke="#272d31" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <g clip-path="url(#vuClip)">
            <circle cx="1142" cy="150" r="110" fill="#41e86e" opacity=".07"/>
            <path d="M 1062 128 A 92 92 0 0 1 1222 128" fill="none" stroke="#4d9a68" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="2 12.5"/>
            <line x1="1142" y1="168" x2="1176" y2="74" stroke="#41e86e" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="1142" cy="168" r="7" fill="#0b1a10" stroke="#4d9a68"/>
          </g>
          <text x="1048" y="62" font-size="10" letter-spacing="2" fill="#8d978f">VU</text>
          <text x="1142" y="182" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2.5" fill="#8d978f" text-anchor="middle">TRANSFORMER</text>
          <!-- serial -->
          <text x="1250" y="222" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="1.5" fill="#5c655f" text-anchor="end">FRM-01 · REFERENCE UNIT · S/N 0001 · MEASURED ON THE BENCH</text>
        </symbol>
      </defs>
    </svg>

    <div class="sitenav-band" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
      <nav class="sitenav inner" aria-label="Site">
        <a href="/">Max Hodges</a><span>/</span><a href="/blog">Projects</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <header>
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="wordmark">GROUND<b>TRUTH</b></div>
        <nav class="product">
          <a href="#frm">Full-Range Modeling</a>
          <a href="#rig">The Rig</a>
          <a href="#accuracy">Accuracy</a>
          <a href="#specs">Specs</a>
          <a href="#waitlist">Waitlist</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="stage" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="unit">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 1320 240"><use href="#fp"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="eyebrow">Groundtruth · FRM-01 · Saturated Channel Processor</div>
        <h1>Modular Channel<br><span class="thin">in full range.</span></h1>
        <p class="sub">A model of the Overstayer® Modular Channel built from <strong>23,040 measured states</strong> of the hardware itself. Not five snapshots of a unit. The whole control surface, every position, every interaction — on as many tracks as your session needs.</p>
        <div class="ctarow">
          <button class="cta" type="button">Join Waitlist</button>
          <span class="ctanote">Release 1.0 · in development</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="statband">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="statrow">
          <div class="stat"><div class="n">23,040</div><div class="l">Captured states</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="n">41</div><div class="l">Positions per control</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="n">−60 dB</div><div class="l">Null-depth target</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="n">0</div><div class="l">Samples of latency</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="n">CLAP</div><div class="l">Native format</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pad">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="sechead">
          <span class="eyebrow">01 · Why</span>
          <h2>The unit that can't be in two places</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="cols">
          <div class="prose">
            <p>The Modular Channel earns its rack space the hard way: dense, musical saturation that flatters almost anything passed through it. The problem was never the sound. The problem is physics. One unit. One insert. It doesn't fly, and it doesn't print six stems at once.</p>
            <p>Groundtruth exists to solve exactly that. We model hardware we own, against measurements of that hardware, and we don't call it done until the model and the unit cancel against each other. The company is named for the practice: in satellite imaging, <em>ground truth</em> is the measurement taken on the ground that the picture from orbit is checked against. Our ground truth is the unit on the bench.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="prose">
            <p class="muted">What that means in a session: the channel you trust on the 2-bus, duplicated across drums, bass, vocal and sends. The same drive curves, the same transformer weight, the same interaction between stages. On a laptop, on a plane, with the hardware an ocean away.</p>
            <p class="muted">And when you get home and print through the real unit, you should hear what our null tests hear: almost nothing changes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="figure unitfig">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 1320 240" role="img" aria-label="Front panel of the Groundtruth FRM-01 reference unit: six knobs, two toggles, signal LED and transformer VU meter on a dark panel"><use href="#fp"/></svg>
          <figcaption>Fig. 0 — FRM-01, the reference unit the model is checked against</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pad" id="frm">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="sechead">
          <span class="eyebrow">02 · Technology</span>
          <h2>Full-Range Modeling</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">Capture-based modeling usually means snapshots: profile the unit at a handful of settings, ship those, and interpolate hope in between. Full-Range Modeling (FRM) replaces the snapshots with a field — a dense grid of measured states covering the entire control surface, used to train a single model that is <em>conditioned</em> on the controls. The knobs in the plugin aren't crossfades between presets. They are inputs to the model, continuous everywhere, because the space between the measurement points was learned, not guessed.</p>

