    <section class="pad" id="specs">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="sechead">
          <span class="eyebrow">06 · Specifications</span>
          <h2>Specs</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="tablewrap">
          <table>
            <tr><th>Format</th><td>CLAP (native). VST3 and AU wrappers planned for 1.1.</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Platform</th><td>macOS 13+, Apple Silicon native. Intel and Windows under evaluation.</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Engine</th><td>Knob-conditioned temporal convolutional network with gray-box transformer hysteresis stage; quantized weights, SIMD inference.</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Latency</th><td>0 samples at all block sizes. No lookahead, no internal buffering.</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Sample rates</th><td>44.1–192 kHz, with internal anti-aliased oversampling in the nonlinear stages.</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Instance count</th><td>Designed for multi-instance use: 6 stereo instances under 15% of one performance core (M1 baseline target).</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Controls</th><td>Continuous across the full captured range. Every parameter automatable and sample-accurate per CLAP spec.</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Status</th><td>In development. This page describes the engineering program and its release criteria.</td></tr>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

